# vzhn/kater-fork#34: added in order as GenMCDriver adds them, the WW race of
# e2 left cexLab = e0, which checkErrors(e5) gave as the race of the double
# free (the clause free;[FREE|HPRET] = 0 set no cexLab); its race is e4
e0: T0 W(x) rlx
e1: T1 TB acq
e2: T1 W(x) rlx
e3: T1 ALLOC(y) na
e4: T1 FREE(y) na
e5: T1 FREE(y) na
mo(x): e0 e2
